    <summary>Offline report card system for Ugandan secondary schools.</summary>
    <description>School Report Maker builds report cards from teacher-entered marks using Uganda A-E grading, aggregates, division and automatic remarks.

It runs fully offline on Windows, keeps the whole school in a single local file with rotating backups, and prints or exports report cards each term. Built and supported by DeryCode Technologies, Kyenjojo, Uganda.</description>
    <releaseNotes>2.3.28: report card layout fixes, faster mark entry, safer backups on shutdown.</releaseNotes>
    <tags>education school reports uganda offline report-cards derycode</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
